            "a": "Partly. The menthol cores give a real <strong>cool throat hit</strong> on the inhale — the physical sensation is there. What's not there is the <span class=\"redact\">nicotine</span> kick. Think of it as the feeling without the substance."
          }
        },
        "q2": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "q": "Is this a <span class=\"redact\">vape</span>?",
            "a": "No. A <strong>wooden aromatherapy diffuser.</strong> No battery, no coil, no liquid, no heating element. You breathe ordinary air through a wooden mouthpiece — the plant-oil core at the end gives it flavor and a cool menthol sensation. Nothing is heated, nothing is combusted."
          }
        },
        "q3": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "q": "Will this change my habit for me?",
            "a": "Honest answer: <strong>willpower isn't included in the box.</strong> Lio handles the hand-to-mouth, the deep breath, the pause — the behavioral half nothing else covers. You still bring the decision. Together, it gets much easier."
          }
        },
        "q4": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "q": "€49 — is it worth it?",
            "a": "Less than a month of packs. The wooden body is <strong>yours to keep forever</strong> — only the cores refill (~€12/month). Most people break even inside three weeks. After that, Lio is cheaper every single day than what it replaces."
          }
        },
        "q5": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "q": "What if it doesn't work for me?",
            "a": "Try it for <strong>90 days</strong>. Use it the way it's meant to be used — every time you'd reach for your old habit. If the ritual doesn't land, <strong>full refund, used or not.</strong> No 'must be sealed' fine print, no restocking fee."
          }
        },
        "q6": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "q": "How long does one core last?",
            "a": "Around <strong>7–10 days for a light user, 3–5 days if you use it heavily.</strong> The flavor is strongest the first day and gradually fades — when you can barely smell it before inhaling, swap it. The wooden body stays with you; only the core changes."
          }
        },
        "q7": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "q": "What's actually in the cores?",
            "a": "Medical-grade polyester fiber infused with <strong>food-safe plant essential oils</strong> — peppermint, cinnamon, mango, orange, depending on the variant. No synthetic aromas, no solvents, no propylene glycol. Third-party tested, every batch."
          }
        },
        "q8": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "q": "Can I use it on a plane or at work?",
            "a": "Yes. No smoke, no vapor, no smell, no electronics — nothing that sets off detectors or bothers the person next to you. Customers use it on flights, in offices, cinemas, in bed next to their kids. Nobody's ever asked one to stop."
          }
        },
        "q9": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "q": "I've read the core can fall out — true?",
            "a": "Early cores had this issue. <strong>The current design fixes it</strong> — slightly fray one end of the core before inserting and it holds firmly. 30-second trick we wish we'd communicated earlier. Every new order ships with instructions."
          }
        },
        "q10": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "q": "Are all the flavors mint-based?",
            "a": "The Starter Pack leans menthol-forward (Minty Magic, Cold Turkey, Cinnamon Spice) because those mimic the throat sensation best. The full range includes <strong>Oh My Orange, Mango Passion, and rotating seasonal cores</strong> that are warm and fruity. Pick refills à la carte."
          }
        },
        "q11": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "q": "How fast does it arrive?",
            "a": "Shipped from the Netherlands. <strong>2–3 working days across Europe, 4–8 days outside.</strong> Free worldwide, no minimum. Tracking link by email the moment it leaves the warehouse."
          }
        },
        "q12": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "q": "I've never smoked. Can I still use Lio?",
            "a": "Absolutely. Many customers use Lio just for the ritual — a mindful pause during work, a calming breath before bed, a fidget for anxious hands. <strong>No ex-smoker card required.</strong> It's an aromatherapy tool at its core."
          }
        }
      },
